Package: linkr
Type: Package
Title: Reach the Current Linkr Project from a Script
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Linkr", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "contact@interhop.org")
Description: Client library for scripts running inside a Linkr IDE session.
    Resolves the project's directories from the environment the kernel or
    terminal was started with, and opens its databases as DBI connections
    without the script having to know where anything lives.
    DBI, duckdb and jsonlite are Suggests rather than Imports on purpose: they
    are resolved at call time from a private library (see R/zzz.R), so that
    installing this package does not put them on the kernel's .libPaths() and
    let a script load them without declaring them in its project environment.
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: utils
Suggests: DBI, duckdb, jsonlite, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
